WEBVTT

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.588
For example, people going through
a difficult or traumatic experience

00:01:32.588 --> 00:01:34.298
such as a divorce,

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:37.009
and who are dreaming about that event,

00:01:37.051 --> 00:01:40.429
go on to gain resolution
to their depression

00:01:40.429 --> 00:01:43.141
relative to those who were dreaming

00:01:43.182 --> 00:01:46.602
but not dreaming
about the events themselves.

00:01:46.936 --> 00:01:48.980
All of which means that sleep

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:52.608
and the very act of dreaming itself

00:01:52.608 --> 00:01:58.114
appears to be an essential ingredient
to so much of our waking lives.

00:01:58.114 --> 00:01:59.448
We dream,

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:01.659
therefore we are.